# Root .dockerignore — applies to ALL image builds against this repo
# (Railway resolves the .dockerignore alongside the build context root,
# which for the api-fastapi service is the repo root). Keep this lean
# enough that the api-fastapi Dockerfile's `COPY .local/skills/` works:
# `.local/skills/` is the IWO2-parity skills bundle (~17 dirs) shipped
# into the container at /app/.local/skills/ for runtime use by Aiden's
# tool-call loop. The Node sandbox image (Dockerfile.node) doesn't
# need .local/skills/ but tolerates its presence in the build context.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
node_modules
dist
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.venv/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.coverage
WS024_IWO3*
docs/adr
infra/local/*.log
coverage
.cache
